*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Minimal PPD used only when "lpadmin -m raw" is not accepted by the local CUPS build.
*% The queue is raw: print data goes to the antiprint backend untouched.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "antiprint.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "AntiPrint"
*ModelName: "AntiPrint virtual printer"
*ShortNickName: "ANTIPRINT"
*NickName: "AntiPrint virtual printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595.28 841.89"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
